r-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\n.cs-content{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;color:#333}\n.cs-content h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 24px;color:#182b38}\n.cs-content h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin:32px 0 16px;color:#182b38}\n.cs-content p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 16px;color:#444}\n.cs-content a{color:#c9553d;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}\n.cs-content a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n.cs-content ul{margin:0 0 24px;padding:0 0 0 20px}\n.cs-content li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px;color:#444}\n.cs-content strong{color:#182b38}\n<\/style><div class=\"cs-content\">\n<p>When a Burleigh Heads homeowner needed their four-bedroom home demolished to make way for a new build, they called Coastal Demolitions. The project at 8 Kingfisher Court required precision, efficiency, and a clean handover \u2014 exactly what Coastal delivers on every <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/services\/demolition\/residential\/\">residential knock-down<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>The result? A flawless demolition with full material recycling, a flat truck-rolled site ready for the builder, and a five-star review from the client.<\/p>\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t<\/section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3f81d8b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3f81d8b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2e8f6ec \" data-id=\"2e8f6ec\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\